  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.86` to `4.1.87`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.86...application_builder_helpers/4.1.87)\n\n## What's Changed\n* docs: overhaul README and add full documentation by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/308\n* fix: update Nuke build paths after src/ restructure by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/311\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 8.0.2 to 8.0.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/309\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260612103915.71c3f70...build.20260617100616.11619ca",
